                "text": "17M will lose their health care, 5M will lose access to SNAP, 15.6M children will have free and reduced lunch impacted, 1.4M students will lose their Pell grants, and the 42M borrowers with student debt can expect increased payments\u2014all to give tax breaks to billionaires.",
