                "retweet_count": 3,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Millions of babies are born each year thanks to IVF \u2014 a reminder of how far reproductive medicine has come. \n\nOn this #IVFDay, I\u2019m standing up for the right to make decisions about our own bodies, our futures, and our families. \n\nThat includes protecting access to IVF.",
