                "text": "Over 4 million Floridians rely on health care tax credits to lower premiums. They expire this year.\n\nThe \u2018Big, Ugly Law\u2019 FAILED to renew them in order to give billionaires tax breaks.\n\nUnless Congress acts, people will lose coverage, and I support extending them. https://t.co/CTCegieUIK",
