                "text": "Today, I toured Borinquen Medical Centers in North Miami and met with the CEO, doctors, and stakeholders.\n\nThey\u2019ve long been a pillar of care in South Florida, and I will always stand with healthcare providers like them and with every American who depends on quality healthcare. https://t.co/sweyc9hvjn",
