                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Thank you to our moderator, @angela_rye, and to all our special guests, including @repjoeneguse, @repraskin, Secretary Miguel Cardona, Secretary Kathleen Sebelius, Secretary Julie Su, and Sui Chung, for joining my teletown hall on our democracy, health, and future. https://t.co/auXqeSrExS",
